# ID-Document-Recognition-Liveness-Detection-Android (customer demo)
# Push: app source, Gradle, README, screenshots, libdocumentlivenesssdk placeholders.
# Do not push: AAR / natives (Drive), secrets, build output, kit-only tooling (scripts/ keeps get_runtime.py + runtime_layout.py).


# --- IDE / local ---
.gradle/
.identixia/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
local.properties
captures/


